# The vendored tarball's own payload, laid down by a manual
# verify-then-run session in this directory:
#
#   sha512sum -c *.sha512sum && b3sum -c *.b3sum && tar xzf *.gz
#
# The extracted release README, the release LICENSE and the 2.2M
# static binary are disposable products — never commit them. The
# tracked pair is only the tarball plus its two sidecars; this
# directory's own doc rides the VENDOR.md name for exactly that
# reason (the tarball's README would clobber a tracked README.md on
# every extraction).
/README.md
/LICENSE
/zelynic
